16-5eb2-b7e7-4471b6fedae0" :question/problem "Calculate $3B+3M$, where\n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $B$ by $3$ and each entry of $M$ by $3,$ and then add the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3B+3M & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3\\cdot 2 & 3\\cdot 4 \\\\ 3\\cdot 1 & 3\\cdot 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3\\cdot 2 & 3\\cdot 0 \\\\ 3\\cdot 3 & 3\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 12 \\\\ 3 & 12\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6+6 & 12+0 \\\\ 3+9 & 12+9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 12 \\\\ 12 & 21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547244 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ae69670-06e2-546c-8cd4-887e558707c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 15 \\\\ -15 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547213} {:answer/id #uuid "3bb6cd12-fb0e-5bb8-a24d-c5a488ba4189" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 12 \\\\ -12 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547217} {:answer/id #uuid "8e8f91d2-fde3-5d2a-83cf-7da3d5c22812" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547236} {:answer/id #uuid "b37fb170-4635-5979-8641-e083ac238d5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547249} {:answer/id #uuid "ecaaabc2-e475-523a-ac9d-e35f29c3309f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -18 \\\\ 18 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547268}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547249} :answer-field/id #uuid "c2b0de36-d947-517b-ac5f-9d13a5c03976" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547253}] :question/id #uuid "a1f995aa-a3a0-5af5-ac63-b17fbecfcac6" :question/problem "Calculate $-2Q+4G$, where\n$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$G=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $Q$ by $-2$ and each entry of $G$ by $4,$ and then add the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2Q+4G & =(-2)\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+4\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-2)\\cdot (-2) & (-2)\\cdot 3 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot (-3) & (-2)\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot (-1) & 4\\cdot 3 \\\\ 4\\cdot (-3) & 4\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -6 \\\\ 6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 12 \\\\ -12 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+(-4) & -6+12 \\\\ 6+(-12) & -4+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186547248 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "299a064b-3bc4-547b-a7d0-c24eca4b4deb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547212} {:answer/id #uuid "3ff42622-2f7e-56ba-8321-981bcc0a144f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547218} {:answer/id #uuid "9a864b72-cebb-5676-996e-e69c04ff80a6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 14 \\\\ 14 & 13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547240} {:answer/id #uuid "b9a5dd37-1aa8-541a-92dc-3f6ead400d51" :answer/type {:db/ident :answe